                           bg-[#F2F2F2] rounded-lg hover:bg-[#A5A5A5]/20 transition-colors"
              >
                Show More Dates ({sortedDates.length - visibleDates} remaining)
              </button>
            )}
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
    </section>
  );
}

