          Last fetched {new Date(demographics.lastUpdated).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
          {' · '}
          Sparklines show year-over-year trend from ACS 5-yr estimates (2014–2023)
